No. So far I have had no side-effects. Should I have had any?

I simply just walk in. Try to get as far as I can from the keeper, and 
still keep him in the firing line - which is actually, at the max only 
one square in between the keeper and you, as every time you try to move
more than one square away from him, he moves out of the path. And he
never ever gets back into the path, until you have at the most one
square in "between" the two of you. 
And after that, just zap him with awand of fire/cold. He'll naturally 
get angry, and hit ya, and do about 30 hp damage (roughly). And then 
one more zap kills him. Grab the loot, and all the items, and then 
generally sort through your prize, and drop the unwanted misc, (and 
then if you want, polypile it)..

Simple as that..

